WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:02.575
JACK
I saw him on TV with a cape,

00:00:02.625 --> 00:00:03.837
shooting laser beams!

00:00:05.758 --> 00:00:06.924
IKARIS
I don't wear a cape.

00:00:08.578 --> 00:00:09.372
KINGO
You are about to meet

00:00:09.422 --> 00:00:11.136
the greatest warriors ever known.

00:00:12.646 --> 00:00:14.006
IKARIS
Eternals assemble.

00:00:15.287 --> 00:00:16.600
THENA
Let's finish this.

00:00:20.498 --> 00:00:22.498
DANE WHITMAN
Are you a wizard, like Doctor Strange?

00:00:22.549 --> 00:00:23.815
SERSI
I'm super normal.

